      <shape width="434" height="22" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="204" type="text" id="blN">
        <content fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(148, 163, 184, 1)" wrap="false">
          <p>We show P10–P90 bands and calibrate them; true black swans stay open.</p>
